# Build context for apps/ai/Dockerfile (built from the repo root so it can
# include packages/shared/pricing.json). Whitelist: everything is excluded,
# then only what the image needs is let back in. Secrets, node_modules, the
# web app and the venv never reach the Docker daemon.
*
!apps/ai/requirements.txt
!apps/ai/app/
!packages/shared/pricing.json
apps/ai/app/__pycache__/
apps/ai/app/*.pyc
